+## Phase 3: User Story 1 - Recover the original signal identity from a lost-acknowledgement retry (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP
+
+**Goal**: A recognized retry of `POST /v1/executions/{id}/signal` answers with the original durable `signalId` inside the recognized-retry proof (`data.idempotency.signalId`), byte-identical to what the first reply returned, stable across repeats and unaffected by later state advancement.
