+## Notes
+
+- `[P]` tasks = different files / no dependency on an incomplete task. Coordinate concurrent `cargo` invocations on the shared package-cache/target lock (wait on `Blocking waiting for file lock`; do not relaunch).
+- `[Story]` label maps each task to a specific user story for traceability; Setup/Foundational/Polish carry no story label.
+- Verify RED before implementing (T006 before T007); keep both records.
+- Commit after each logical group; every commit carries the identity line and, where applicable, `Refs #…` (never a closing keyword next to an unintended issue).
+- Offline throughout: no network, Docker, credentials, providers, or browser sessions; fixed IDs/clock in tests.
+- The change touches exactly one source file (`apps/cli/src/commands/serve/mod.rs`) and two test files; any deviation (new module, type, public fn, or dependency) violates plan.md Scope and must be called out.
